{
  "schema_version": "oopz.design.tokens.v2",
  "_doc": "All visual constants of the V7 template. Sizes are CSS-like pixels on the 1x canvas; the painter supersamples by canvas.scale. Every type size must be >= type_floor_px (checked at load time).",
